{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳煒（煒哥）多年來樣貌與身材始終如一，是圈中公認的「凍齡」女神。近日煒哥終於完成劇集拍攝，迎來放鬆休息的時光，她緊貼潮流去試玩近期極受歡迎的 Pickleball（匹克球），並在社交平台上載打波片段，興奮發文：「人生第一次接觸pickleball，原來真係幾好玩喎，好大運動量，出一身汗超正！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"14876db4-4f51-401c-a68d-a85170fe089b.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026SnwPmyoiiM1790238435.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"14876db4-4f51-401c-a68d-a85170fe089b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">從片段可見，煒哥在運動造型上花了不少心思。她紮起青春馬尾，身穿純白色貼身運動背心，下身配搭百褶短裙以及白色及膝長襪仔，散發出滿滿的青春氣息。這身打扮不僅完美展現出她零贅肉的白滑小蠻腰，更讓一雙修長美腿表露無遺，畫面相當養眼。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7750de23-4ddd-4767-bb38-5d0f83c3a392.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ZwtVL3TZWd1790238435.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7750de23-4ddd-4767-bb38-5d0f83c3a392.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fa370188-4fe5-460b-b509-05db0814a03d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026kEexzJru3p1790238435.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fa370188-4fe5-460b-b509-05db0814a03d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了弗爆身材吸睛，煒哥在場上全程打得似模似樣，有姿勢又有實際，完全不似是首次接觸。煒哥接受 <a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"http://tvb.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">tvb.com</a> 獨家訪問時直認這項運動十分好玩，更笑言自己特意悉心打扮全副武裝上陣是「唔打得都睇得吓」。她透露獲教練大讚有天份：「可能我細個有打乒乓波，有啲概念，但打完第二日臀部同大臂好痛，個運動量都大，但我都會Keep住玩，我覺得都幾好玩。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T09:19:15.376069+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":429,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}